key B BENCH block
key n NOTICE_BOARD block
key q FENCE_POST block
key h FENCE_H block
key v FENCE_V block
key P RIPE_PUMPKIN block
key C RIPE_CORN block
key S RIPE_STRAWB block
key R FRUIT_TREE_RIPE block
key W WELL block
